comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-29T11:07:06.885Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: the complete all-status corpus and fresh Sentry CLI 3.8.2 search identify pm-ogzvx6 as the open ongoing cohort. Live open and in-progress inventories and full cohort comments were read. This finite version-specific leaf covers the newly eligible Sentry update while that existing cohort retains the remaining future candidates. No other matching active leaf was found."
  "2026-10-29T11:11:39.888Z","harness:codex","Registry cutoff passed at 11:03:02 UTC on October 29. Installed Sentry CLI 3.8.2 and synchronized only its native packages in pnpm-lock.yaml; supported Node engine remains >=18. Actual binary reports 3.8.2. In an isolated temporary JavaScript/source-map fixture, sourcemaps inject produced matching debug IDs and the instrumented bundle still executed with expected output 42. No fixture was uploaded. The linked development-dependency integrity check passes; production code and runtime dependency versions are unchanged."
  "2026-10-29T11:21:04.081Z","harness:codex","Post-upgrade build, dependency cooldown policy, 42-package runtime-lock check, package-boundary audit and linked development-dependency integrity check pass. pnpm audit reports zero info/low/moderate/high/critical advisories across the unchanged 567-dependency inventory. Lockfile inspection limits the upgrade to Sentry CLI and its platform binaries. Current core source separately passes the full 11573-test exact-coverage suite; final hosted acceptance remains pending."
  "2026-10-29T11:31:23.339Z","harness:codex","The tracker-context gate caught a missing estimated_minutes value on this new active leaf. Supplied the 30-minute estimate through pm; graph composition, record integrity and full history validation already pass. Rechecking the unchanged context gate before final closeout."
  "2026-10-29T16:05:11.823Z","harness:codex","Final review hardening: pin the manifest exactly to 3.8.2, matching the already-reviewed frozen lockfile and unchanged native package graph. This prevents a future lock refresh from selecting another credential-bearing release-tool version through a broad range."
